---
layout: layouts/base.njk
---

{# Hero #}
<section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
        <div class="badge reveal">AI-Powered Relationship Intelligence</div>
        <h1 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">
            The AI that<br><span class="hero-gradient-text">truly knows you</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="hero-subtitle reveal reveal-delay-2">Meet Julie — your personal relationship advisor who learns who you are, understands your people, and helps you show up better for the ones who matter.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions reveal reveal-delay-3">
            <a href="{{ site.appUrl }}" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" target="_blank">Get Started Free</a>
            <a href="#features" class="btn btn-secondary btn-lg">See How It Works</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{# Meet Julie #}
<section class="julie-section-home" id="julie">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="julie-content">
            <div class="julie-text">
                <span class="section-label reveal">Meet Julie</span>
                <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">She already<br>knows you</h2>
                <p class="reveal reveal-delay-2">Julie isn't a chatbot. She's an AI with genuine warmth who builds a deep, evolving understanding of who you are — your patterns, your strengths, what makes you tick.</p>
                <p class="reveal reveal-delay-3">The more you talk to her, the more she sees. She remembers what matters. She notices what you miss. And she helps you understand yourself in ways that change how you connect with everyone around you.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="julie-visual reveal">
                <div class="julie-orb"></div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{# Features #}
<section class="features-section" id="features">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
            <span class="section-label reveal">Features</span>
            <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">Everything you need to understand yourself and your people</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid-4">
            <div class="feature-card reveal">
                <div class="feature-icon feature-icon-purple">
                    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"></circle></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Know Yourself</h3>
                <p>AI-generated insights about your patterns, tendencies, and blind spots — built from real conversations, not quizzes.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-delay-1">
                <div class="feature-icon feature-icon-pink">
                    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"></path><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"></circle><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"></path><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Your Circle</h3>
                <p>Deep relationship intelligence for the people who matter most. Understand how you connect, where things get stuck, and what to do about it.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-delay-2">
                <div class="feature-icon feature-icon-blue">
                    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12" y2="12"></line><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12.01" y2="16"></line></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>The Outlook</h3>
                <p>A living read on your energy and relationships right now. Know when to push forward, when to pause, and when to have the hard conversation.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="feature-card reveal reveal-delay-3">
                <div class="feature-icon feature-icon-green">
                    <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z"></path><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5"></path><path d="M2 12l10 5 10-5"></path></svg>
                </div>
                <h3>Memory That Grows</h3>
                <p>Every conversation makes Julie smarter about you. Your insights get richer, your pages fill up, and the advice gets sharper — automatically.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{# How It Works #}
<section class="how-it-works" id="how-it-works">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
            <span class="section-label reveal">How It Works</span>
            <h2 class="reveal reveal-delay-1">Simple to start,<br>powerful over time</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="steps">
            <div class="step reveal">
                <div class="step-number">1</div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h3>Share who you are</h3>
                    <p>A few basics about yourself, and Julie starts reading you immediately. You'll be surprised what she picks up.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step reveal reveal-delay-1">
                <div class="step-number">2</div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h3>Add your people</h3>
                    <p>Tell Julie about the people who matter to you. She builds a profile for each one and starts mapping your dynamics.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step reveal reveal-delay-2">
                <div class="step-number">3</div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h3>Talk naturally</h3>
                    <p>Chat with Julie about your day, your relationships, what's on your mind. She listens, distills, and learns.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="step reveal reveal-delay-3">
                <div class="step-number">4</div>
                <div class="step-content">
                    <h3>Watch it grow</h3>
                    <p>Your pages fill with insights. Julie surfaces patterns you'd never see on your own. The longer you use it, the more valuable it becomes.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

{# CTA #}
<section class="cta-section">
    <div class="container">
        <h2 class="reveal">Your relationships deserve<br>better than guesswork</h2>
        <p class="reveal reveal-delay-1">Start a conversation with Julie today.</p>
        <div class="reveal reveal-delay-2">
            <a href="{{ site.appUrl }}" class="btn btn-on-dark btn-lg" target="_blank">Get Started Free</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
